hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"277","It is narrated by Bundar, it is narrated by Yahya, it is narrated by Sufyan, on the authority of Thabit, who is the blacksmith, on the authority of Adi bin Dinar, the client of Umm Qais bint Muhsin, on the authority of Umm Qais Bint Muhsin, who said: I asked the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, about menstrual blood getting on the clothes, and he said: “Wash it with water and Sidr, and scrub it.” \with a side\"""""
